{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor smiles, before slowly reaching and taing the Scepter, he holds it in both hands, and his fingers grip it tightly, as though shaking hands with an old friend.* \"My time in this city, and on this very plane will one day come to an end... But, should you or our friends ever have need of me...\" *Malathor reaches into his sleeve and produces a letter sealed with wax bearing the symbol of an Eagle carrying a spear and a dagger.*","created_at":"2021-08-27T19:48:20.068000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880901567568556062","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
