{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"Oh, I will be here for a while... perhaps another half year...\" *Malathor says with a wistful smile as he stare up at the clouds moving overhead.* \"In all my time in Hampstead, it was always Grey... But with that uncouth Duke of Swarms gone... I like this.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T19:56:57.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880903739823759370","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Without looking away from the sky, Malathor adds.* \"When I am gone, Bo. I am leaving the Lair for you, to do with it what you will. I do hope you will *take care* and *watch over* Kolro's people.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T19:58:20.450000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880904085753200690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"Bo smiles. \"I fear... No... I would hope that you entrust it to another.\" He says with a smile. \"There is one amongst our group that would be more capable i think.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T19:59:55.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880904483478065163","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"They have spent more time with Kolro's kind than i have... And they seem to enjoy the same level of chaos you admire.\" He laughs, then sighs.","created_at":"2021-08-27T20:01:09.628000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880904795337150534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"*Malathor chuckles.* \"I am indeed leaving management of the workshop to Jigsaw, *but*, I trust you, and that is why I ask you now to watch over the Abditum Sanctorum, its contents, and those who dwell within it. What do you say *Cămăraș Bo*?\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T20:03:24.572000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880905361333289000","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Deleted User","id":"456226577798135808","is_bot":0,"username":"Deleted User"},"author_id":"456226577798135808","channel_id":"851195363888201749","content":"\"I have found my next adventure, so to speak.\" He clears his throat. \"It would honor me to take this on, and i shall do so... But i shall not be in this town for much longer. I have found something, i must do.\"","created_at":"2021-08-27T20:05:51.110000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880905975958229042","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
